      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk man. just finished another 12 hour shift and i feel like im just... disappearing. like i'm just a part in a machine that doesn't even know i'm here. tomorrow i'll wake up, do it all again, and if i dropped dead tomorrow the warehouse wouldn't even skip a beat. it's just a loop of nothing.",
